+WSGI and ASGI app classes. The registered reporter is a plain synchronous
+callable that is invoked for every exception passed to the app's error
+handling (including :class:`~falcon.HTTPError` and
+:class:`~falcon.HTTPStatus`), before the matching error handler is called,
+which makes it easy to log exceptions or send them to an error tracker.
